{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7ccbaaea607a3581231256cd3cc5f4a5b23c5768f73533b7d8b819e4864adc0b","ja":"出現、ミステリーサークル！？","zh":"神秘麦田圈出现！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2173ab1e291cdacc289165b4e8e0ff25f11eb875a58020aa5476fada725aefff","ja":"おはようさん。……あのね、聞きたいんだけども、\n今日、誰か劇場の裏の方には行ったかい？","zh":"早上好。……那个啊，我想问一下，\n今天有谁去剧场后面那边了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3d9e088bb3bd245dc936cb3e19001680945808cf6759115b46ac9e48b13c608f","ja":"えっ？　ううん、私は行ってないけど……。\nどうかしたの？","zh":"诶？　没有，我没去……。\n怎么了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fa491fc21beb8ae4559747e6c6c76db88ff8e893ca274d16bf9694df1150f8e0","ja":"地面に、おっきな変な模様があってねぇ。\nそれで、誰が描いたのかなって……。","zh":"地面上有个大大的奇怪图案呢。\n我在想是谁画的呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8e88e7cafcc334aea22f10dcea40426577ac6da71182c59b66a0e530294c4941","ja":"姫も知らないのです。\n気になるので、今からみんなで見に行ってみませんか？","zh":"公主也不知道呢。\n既然这么好奇，要不要现在大家一起去看看呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ad7c6278f9cf0e498c33e6da12134ab687345f42f7c97327ed788e878af3373f","ja":"同じような線が、いっぱい描いてあるわね……。\n何かしら、これ……？","zh":"画满了相似的线条呢……\n这是什么……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c0bb1cfff900c780c30d123aecc1482e50f26a0368291927caf03a827462b944","ja":"このみさんも分からないのかい？","zh":"小实也不明白吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"2bbfe85b4ecc0e49475d3c1e41ff69a5a0a365e1353c4a85dbd5738275785de4","ja":"うーん……丸が何重にも描いてあったりして、\nなにかの模様みたいにも見えるんだけど……？","zh":"嗯……圆被画了好几层，\n看起来也像是某种图案……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"780686063901bc92e4f158afcaae0520c6ee38bfc71453a13515447bb59cb9af","ja":"なんだか、ミステリーサークルみたいなのです。","zh":"总觉得像是麦田怪圈一样呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"a222c65d0f7006bb84cdbe8f8e99cab28605419a85217afe1bb7fc761da0c3bf","ja":"それって、宇宙人が描くっていうやつかい？","zh":"那就是外星人画的吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"9f94cb42b503fbf4fe402f9c1b811d58766492837c239f6c9f6a57cf5b0b63b6","ja":"そうね。他にも、地球人が宇宙人を呼ぶために\n描いてる、って説もあるみたいだけど……。","zh":"也是呢。此外，好像也有说法认为\n是地球人为了呼唤外星人才画的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"35bb97a77d3d8ca2313ec82bb4cab00fa2a33fea55541be42abda3f603301f1d","ja":"ええっ！？　じゃあここで誰かが、\n宇宙人と会おうとしてるのかい？","zh":"咦！？那也就是说有人正打算\n在这里和外星人见面吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"ea51c651afc968c7313e061e876019271f9ef5dbdf953397c316c410ad963428","ja":"……って、そんなわけないわよね。\nごめんごめん、言ってみただけよ。","zh":"……怎么可能嘛。\n抱歉抱歉，我只是随口说说啦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a7fbc680ca3ee630d3e7dc68df44083b3441d8c5e72c37b179797f16ab1bbff1","ja":"気にすることはないのです。きっと誰かの……\n妖精さんのイタズラかもしれないのですよ。","zh":"不用放在心上哦。说不定是谁的……\n小妖精恶作剧也说不定呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1227.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"17a41ecd75e10a4b4420a6fc95812d3611b453828d61d867192f29ad14895c32","ja":"それはそれで、とっても不思議な\n出来事だけど……宇宙人よりはいいのかしら？","zh":"那也是一件非常不可思议的\n事情呢……不过总比外星人好吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
